# PSR-5 — data authority inventory (no refactor)

## Goal (this wave only)

Complete **PSR-5 item 1** and a first-pass of **item 3**: list every dual
memory/prisma factory, document the environment matrix, and classify every
non-spec `getPrismaAdmin()` site under `apps/api/src`.

**Forbidden in this wave:** deleting admin calls, changing RLS posture, Harbor
productionize, or any storage migration.

## Environment matrix

| Profile | Memory boot | Prisma | Enforcer |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `test` | allowed | allowed | harness / `STORAGE_DRIVER` |
| `development` | allowed (default if no `DATABASE_URL`) | allowed | none at factory unless called |
| `production` | **forbidden** | required | `assertProductionStorageDriver` via `assertProductionRuntimeIntegrity` |
| `prodlike` | **forbidden** | required | `requiresProductionGradeIntegrity()` same path |

Source: `resolveStorageDriver` + `assertProductionStorageDriver` in
`apps/api/src/storage/production-storage-driver-assert.ts`, wired from
`assertProductionRuntimeIntegrity()`.

## Dual-store factories (10)

| Domain | Path | Local `assertProductionStorageDriver` |
| --- | --- | --- |
| bookings | `create-bookings-repository.ts` | yes |
| identity | `create-identity-repository.ts` | yes |
| portal member plan | `portal-member-plan.service.ts` | yes |
| tour storage | `create-tour-storage.ts` | yes |
| settings ×3 | `create-settings-*-repository.ts` | yes |
| drafts ×2 | `create-workspace-drafts*.ts` | yes |
| **finance** | `finance-repository.factory.ts` | **yes** (PSR-5a) |

Boot-time integrity blocks memory in production/prodlike. PSR-5a added
factory-local assert so finance matches bookings/identity/drafts.

## `getPrismaAdmin` in `apps/api/src` (non-spec)

| Class | Files | Calls≈ | PSR-5 bucket |
| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
| `control_plane` | 29 | 31 | legitimate control-plane candidate |
| `background_repair` | 20 | 50 | background/repair; audit trail still open |
| `tenant_registry` | 2 | 4 | routing hot path; needs named port (item 5) |
| `tenant_path_allowlist_candidate` | 2 | 13 | intentional today; needs owner/reason/expiry |
| `seed_dev` | 1 | 2 | keep out of production request path |
| `definition` | 1 | 1 | `db/prisma.ts` |
| **Total** | **55** | **106** | — |
| `unclassified` | **0** | — | ratchet |

### Allowlist candidates (not yet formal allowlist)

1. **`identity/prisma-identity.repository.ts`** (~12 calls) — `user` /
   `mobileOtpChallenge` FORCE RLS deny for app role; pre-tenant login has no
   GUC. Comment in source already documents admin-only OTP/user reads.
2. **`workspace-finance/resolve-finance-workspace-type-for-tenant.ts`** — admin
   `tenant.findUnique` when `DATABASE_URL` set; falls back to static registry.
   Used from finance composition (tenant-adjacent).

### Tenant registry (every request)

`resolve-registered-tenant.ts` and `update-tenant-registry-row.ts` use the admin
pool for cache-miss reads/writes and already emit `recordAdminPoolRead` metrics.
PSR-5 item 5 wants a **named** control-plane interface + reason code rather than
raw `getPrismaAdmin()` imports.

